1
00:00:45,168 --> 00:00:49,480
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,505 --> 00:00:51,377
=Episode 22=

3
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,799
Lanxi, we have the Heavenly Justice now.

4
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:55,840
How's your side?

5
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,280
A person has three souls
and seven spirits.

6
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,920
The Underworld Soul

7
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:02,520
must be refined from the heart-blood
of someone brought back from death.

8
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,600
It's not easy.

9
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,719
Give me more time.

10
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,640
Our Yuanzhen Sect has a technique

11
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,280
that can help.

12
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:14,599
Make the refining twice as fast.

13
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:18,840
How dare a servant instruct me?

14
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:26,319
I'm tired from refining today.

15
00:01:26,319 --> 00:01:27,439
Leave me.

16
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:29,720
The Underworld Soul
isn't something you refine.

17
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:33,560
If you truly came back from death,

18
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,239
you would know that.

19
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,280
Ziyan,

20
00:01:45,639 --> 00:01:47,400
I keep thinking lately

21
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,560
about how you
suffered from the Stone Curse

22
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:51,799
and I couldn't be there for you.

23
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:54,560
How did you endure it?

24
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,680
How much pain were you in?

25
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,599
Likewise,

26
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:02,719
if you hadn't experienced
the agony of dying unjustly,

27
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,480
you wouldn't know
how to cherish what I have now.

28
00:02:07,193 --> 00:02:08,266
From now on,

29
00:02:09,958 --> 00:02:12,159
I will always be by your side.

30
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,479
Lanxi,

31
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,039
don't worry.

32
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:21,080
From now on,

33
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,879
I'll protect you.

34
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:26,960
My dear Ziyan.

35
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:37,439
But we still need the Tearless Tear.

36
00:02:38,206 --> 00:02:40,160
Making godmother cry

37
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,980
is nearly impossible.

38
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,599
(While mother
is cultivating in the illusion,)

39
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:08,400
(I can use the Spirit-Calling Art
to link my sense to hers.)

40
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,360
(If I cry,)

41
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:12,439
(she should cry too.)

42
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,240
You're here.

43
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,479
Mother,

44
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,039
you're awake.

45
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:30,099
I am the one
who taught you the Spirit-Calling Art.

46
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:33,800
Don't try to show off in front of me.

47
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,159
It seems

48
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:41,919
you can freely
use the Stone's power now.

49
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,759
You knew I was the Stone all along.

50
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,599
Hmph.

51
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,586
You little demon brat,

52
00:03:49,666 --> 00:03:51,919
did you think you were hiding it well?

53
00:03:52,630 --> 00:03:56,389
(Lanruo Hall)

54
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,479
Mother.

55
00:03:58,503 --> 00:03:59,096
Mm.

56
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:02,120
If I get married someday,

57
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,680
would you cry?

58
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:09,439
I'm a Lishuo Rabbit Demon

59
00:04:09,953 --> 00:04:11,152
born without tears.

60
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,985
Besides, a wedding is a happy occasion.

61
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,972
It's not like we'll never
see each other again.

62
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,920
Why would I cry?

63
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,120
When I found you,

64
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,240
you were this tiny.

65
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,920
And now I've raised you into a demon

66
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,120
who's clever and independent.

67
00:04:30,305 --> 00:04:33,680
It's the best thing I've ever done.

68
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,519
Wow!

69
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,959
You need to learn some patience.

70
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:47,199
Try again. Put it on.

71
00:04:47,419 --> 00:04:48,439
Is it pretty?

72
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:51,959
Mm.

73
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,560
Truly lovely.

74
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:55,680
I love it, mother!

75
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,279
Mother.

76
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,480
Are you smoking again?

77
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,240
Oh, just two puffs.

78
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:02,839
I will not let you.

79
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,680
Give it back.

80
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,480
No!

81
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,279
Give it back!

82
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,319
I'll drink with you.

83
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,519
Cheers!

84
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,120
I am sorry, mother.

85
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,879
But given the present situation,

86
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:26,800
I must fight Yu Linjun to the very end.

87
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:36,040
In our clan, if we shed tears,

88
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:38,480
we go blind.

89
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,079
My mother was tricked into crying.

90
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:44,519
She lost her sight and died.

91
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,959
So I told myself from childhood

92
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,279
never to feel.

93
00:05:51,705 --> 00:05:53,519
Only a heart of stone

94
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,885
can help me survive.

95
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,839
Mother.

96
00:06:35,012 --> 00:06:35,812
Mother.

97
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,560
What are you doing?

98
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:53,160
Only I can take

99
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:56,160
my own tears.

100
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,720
There's only one in this world.

101
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:01,680
Take it.

102
00:07:02,653 --> 00:07:04,745
Mother, your eyes...

103
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,360
Just take it.

104
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,399
But,

105
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,800
you must promise me.

106
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,240
Don't cry for me.

107
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:33,879
The Tearless Tear isn't free.

108
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,839
Once Yu Linjun falls,

109
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,720
you must become the ruler of demons.

110
00:07:43,839 --> 00:07:45,120
If Yu Linjun could do it,

111
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,800
my daughter can too.

112
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,399
This is your wedding dress.

113
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,480
I only sewed half of it for you.

114
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,000
The other half

115
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,560
you'll have to finish yourself.

116
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:17,639
Mother.

117
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:25,920
(Lanruo Hall)

118
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:37,759
I, Shangguan Ziyan,

119
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,519
leave for wedding

120
00:08:39,759 --> 00:08:40,879
and bid farewell to mother.

121
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:51,200
(Lanruo Hall)

122
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:12,679
This is?

123
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,879
We demon women

124
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,960
sew our own wedding dresses.

125
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:22,279
It means we must seek our own happiness

126
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:24,200
with our own hands.

127
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,559
I used to make clothes

128
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,879
for Master and Yuanlang.

129
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,440
Since this is your happiness,

130
00:09:47,679 --> 00:09:49,279
I want to help too.

131
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,200
Young Taoist,

132
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:56,879
tomorrow, my sister will finish
the Underworld Soul.

133
00:09:57,426 --> 00:09:58,840
After my wedding,

134
00:09:59,173 --> 00:10:00,519
I'll kill Yu Linjun.

135
00:10:04,159 --> 00:10:06,679
And then I'll still eat you as my cure.

136
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:12,799
Do you have any last wish?

137
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:17,960
As long as Yu Linjun dies

138
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,240
and the sky is mended,

139
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:22,240
I have no regrets.

140
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:28,759
(If you don't remember me,
you won't be in pain.)

141
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,480
(This is the best ending.)

142
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,440
Is it pretty?

143
00:10:43,379 --> 00:10:44,180
Mm.

144
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,799
It is beautiful.

145
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:06,360
♪Flowers bloom in turn,
as day and night trade places♪

146
00:11:07,620 --> 00:11:08,419
Just like

147
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,360
you and I.

148
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,559
the first time we met.

149
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:21,289
♪Beneath the boundless sky,
I turn toward the break of dawn♪

150
00:11:22,156 --> 00:11:23,576
♪I look back on this mortal world♪

151
00:11:23,609 --> 00:11:29,443
♪Fading traces of a fragile life,
lost in a dream♪

152
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:33,443
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

153
00:11:33,703 --> 00:11:36,549
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

154
00:11:36,570 --> 00:11:40,603
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

155
00:11:40,636 --> 00:11:43,696
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

156
00:11:43,716 --> 00:11:46,029
♪Let the wind sweep away♪

157
00:11:46,053 --> 00:11:51,127
♪This heavy air of sorrow♪

158
00:11:51,176 --> 00:11:53,236
♪Do not forget the tangled paths♪

159
00:11:53,263 --> 00:11:58,256
♪That you and I have crossed♪

160
00:11:58,816 --> 00:12:02,483
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

161
00:12:02,507 --> 00:12:06,393
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

162
00:12:06,416 --> 00:12:12,363
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪

163
00:12:32,432 --> 00:12:36,360
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

164
00:12:36,632 --> 00:12:39,805
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

165
00:12:39,846 --> 00:12:43,478
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

166
00:12:43,503 --> 00:12:46,480
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

167
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:53,500
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

168
00:12:54,176 --> 00:13:00,864
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

169
00:13:01,770 --> 00:13:05,440
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

170
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:09,240
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

171
00:13:09,338 --> 00:13:15,804
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
